error[E0277]: `StampSource` is not a publish transform for `ForSlot` writing `()`
  --> tests/ui/reply_transform_on_slot.rs:58:14
   |
58 |             .transform(StampSource)
   |              ^^^^^^^^^ unsatisfied trait bound
   |
   = note: a transform states its position by the kind it implements: `PublishTransform<K>` for every `K: ContextKind` mounts anywhere, `PublishTransform<ForReply<C>>` reads the delivery and mounts on a reply, `PublishTransform<ForSlot>` mounts on an `Out` slot. A slot publish is issued by the handler body, so it has no delivery to hand on
   = note: a transform also states the broker's per-message options it writes, and mounts only over a publisher whose `Publisher::Options` is that type: `()` here. One that writes none is generic over them - `impl<K: ContextKind, Options> PublishTransform<K, Options> for ..` - and mounts anywhere
help: the trait `PublishTransform<ForSlot, ()>` is not implemented for `StampSource`
      but trait `PublishTransform<ForReply<_>, ()>` is implemented for it
  --> tests/ui/reply_transform_on_slot.rs:27:1
   |
27 | impl<C, Options> PublishTransform<ForReply<C>, Options> for StampSource {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: for that trait implementation, expected `ForReply<_>`, found `ForSlot`
   = note: required for `ruststream_runtime::slot::position::SlotProbe<MemoryPublish, MemoryBroker>` to implement `ruststream_runtime::slot::position::TransformProbe<StampSource>`
